WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.412
In tutorial 9.8, you'll read
your weekly link-building report.

00:00:11.685 --> 00:00:17.297
First, open Reports. Under Type, choose
Link building, then open this week's report.

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:23.575
The top sums up the week: pitches
drafted, journalist requests,

00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:25.962
listings still to add, and redirects.

00:00:27.114 --> 00:00:29.914
Pitches drafted this week names each site.

00:00:29.964 --> 00:00:33.930
The line above says how many others
were checked and left out, and why.

00:00:35.189 --> 00:00:39.264
Next, Podcast shows that take
guests lists shows on your topics.

00:00:39.314 --> 00:00:42.356
A guest spot earns a link
from the show's own page.

00:00:43.345 --> 00:00:47.470
Assets that earn links in your market
shows the kinds of page your competitors

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.388
earned links with, and
the pages that prove it.

00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:54.566
Then check your listings,
the redirects to add,

00:00:54.616 --> 00:00:56.989
and what each won link did for its page.

00:00:59.362 --> 00:01:02.777
Finally, download the PDF,
or Share it with a link,

00:01:02.827 --> 00:01:05.304
or click Open Link building to act on it.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:11.338
Every week, your link openings arrive
in one short read, ready to act on.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.495
Good to know: nothing
in it is sent for you.

00:01:15.545 --> 00:01:18.778
Every pitch waits for your
approval on the Link building page.

00:01:19.783 --> 00:01:24.573
So, open the report, see the pitches,
find podcasts, see what earns links,

00:01:24.623 --> 00:01:27.219
check listings and
redirects, and download it.

00:01:28.172 --> 00:01:32.714
Next, invite your team and choose
their roles, in tutorial 10.1.
